et":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-7c"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"到最后，加奈的生活还是在频繁的出院入院之间更替着。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-d3","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-d3"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"突然就出院的话可能会让她本人感觉到什么，并且更重要的是因为她的健康状况不是在一个让人心安的状态。即使如此，加奈还是精神不错的，每天从已不是占据她全部时间的病院和学校间往返。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-162","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-162"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在这种，和以往变化并不大的日常中，唯有的一些不同就是曾经很久才来探病一次的刻意疏远的父亲和将加奈的事情事无巨细都推脱给我的母亲，现在却频繁的出现了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1f9","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1f9"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"本来的话，为了加奈不起什么疑心而陷入恐惧中，应该要持续至今为止的生活模式。但是，知道将会失去女儿了，哪怕一天也好能多见见面的话也是作为父母的人之常情吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-293","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-293"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"那一天，在去看望加奈时，发现伊藤勇太站在病房前。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2db","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-2db"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"平素里给人以超然洒脱印象的勇太，不知今天为什么看起来有些脆弱。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-379","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-379"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「喂，勇太」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-3a1","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-3a1"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「啊……前辈」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-3d4","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-3d4"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「怎么了？」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-3fc","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-3fc"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「诶……啊，那个……」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-434","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-434"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「是来看望加奈的吧？」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-467","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-467"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……哈」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-4de","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-4de"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"和平时不同，有些支支吾吾。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-506","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-506"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不经意间想到。","speaker":"旁白"}},