-6d3","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-6d3"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"夕美。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-6f1","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-6f1"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"还有勇太。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-712","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-712"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"三个人的面庞，不知为何在我眼前挥之不去。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-75d","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-75d"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「加奈，进来了」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-7ca","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-7ca"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"一进入房间，就看见加奈的笑脸向我迎来。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-806","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-806"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……哥哥，欢迎回来」","speaker":"加奈"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-83f","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-83f"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「我回来了。今天有很少见的客人呦」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-875","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev43/zh-ja","sectionId":